      "readme": "# PAFIN: PennLINC AFfective INstability- fMRIPrep Derivatives\n\nThis dataset contains fMRIPrep derivatives for the PAFIN dataset (https://openneuro.org/datasets/ds006131).\n\nThese derivatives were produced by first running a Python translation of NORDIC (https://github.com/nipreps/NORDIC_Raw/tree/executable), followed by fMRIPrep 25.2.4, using BABS (https://pennlinc-babs.readthedocs.io/).\n\nThe processing code is available at https://github.com/PennLINC/affective-instability/tree/main/processing/nordic-fmriprep.",
